  "description": {
    "about": {
      "items": [
        {
          "items": [
            "Located in the front of Seacrest Beach, where convenience truly matters, \"Sandy Cheeks\" is a beautifully renovated three-story coastal retreat designed to host up to 16 guests. When you can be closer to the pool and the beach, there is no reason to settle for the back of the neighborhood. This prime location means less walking, more beach time, and effortless access to everything that makes Seacrest so special.<br><br>This spacious four-bedroom, four-bath home offers the perfect blend of comfort and style, ideal for entertaining, afternoon naps, or cozy movie nights after a sun-filled day.<br><br>The first floor features an open-concept living space with a fully equipped kitchen, dining area, and inviting family room, along with a King guest bedroom and a nearby full bathroom.<br><br>On the second floor, you will find a luxurious King primary suite, a fun Queen bunk room that sleeps eight, plus twin hall bunks and a shared hall bathroom. Both bedrooms open to private patios, perfect for morning coffee or unwinding in the evening.<br><br>The third floor is home to another beautiful King primary suite, complete with a private balcony, dedicated office space, and a large outdoor patio, an ideal gathering spot to enjoy ocean breezes and relaxed coastal evenings.<br><br>Just 350 yards from private beach access and directly across from the resort-style community pool, Sandy Cheeks delivers the location guests are always wishing they had. Gather your family and friends and experience Seacrest Beach the way it was meant to be enjoyed.<br><br>Community Pool: Please note this pool is not heated. <br><br>Beach Access: You have public and private beach access at this property a short distance away. To utilize the private beach access you do need to rent chairs from the beach service for a daily fee. <br><br>Note; Parking for this home is BEHIND the home. There are 3 spaces behind the home. The 'A' spaces in front of the home are for the condos across the street. If you park in the 'A' spaces, you will be ticketed or towed. Golf carts are NOT allowed in Seacrest.<br><br>Here at Modern Beach Vacation Rentals, we strive for perfection with our attention to detail and level of customer service that no other company in town will match. We hope you choose this property, as we’ll do all we can to make sure you have an amazing and memorable vacation!<br><br>You will find everything you need in the property to make the most of your time on the Emerald Coast. We offer a starter kit of premium, eco-friendly guest amenities including: Shampoo, Conditioner, Body and Face Soap, Toilet Paper, Facial Tissues, Dish Soap, Dishwasher Pods, Laundry Detergent, Paper Towels, Trash Bags, Dish Sponge, Bath Towels, and Bed linens.",
            "Our prices include all fees. No hidden fees."
          ],
          "title": "Sandy Cheeks - Stunning 4 Bedroom with 4 bikes & seconds to the Resort Pool!"
        }
      ],
